WEBVTT

00:00:25.690 --> 00:00:27.440
Good morning!

00:00:29.610 --> 00:00:30.740
Yeah.

00:00:37.070 --> 00:00:39.370
Asahi was worried about you.

00:00:39.540 --> 00:00:42.120
You didn't log in yesterday.

00:00:42.290 --> 00:00:44.290
I went out with my family.

00:00:44.460 --> 00:00:46.750
Well, if that's all...

00:00:47.500 --> 00:00:49.420
It's behind us now.

00:00:49.590 --> 00:00:52.800
It's not like we'd just stop being childhood friends.

00:00:52.970 --> 00:00:53.970
Don't worry about it.

00:00:56.340 --> 00:00:57.470
You know...

00:01:08.190 --> 00:01:09.980
I actually feel better now.

00:01:10.820 --> 00:01:13.440
But if Asahi rejects you,

00:01:13.610 --> 00:01:16.450
you can throw yourself into my arms any time.

00:01:19.330 --> 00:01:20.580
Laugh.

00:01:20.740 --> 00:01:22.620
You're supposed to laugh.

00:01:24.710 --> 00:01:26.500
KUSAKA

00:01:27.830 --> 00:01:30.500
-You finally came.
-Takanori!

00:01:31.050 --> 00:01:32.300
I asked him to come.

00:01:32.460 --> 00:01:34.130
I know this is important.

00:01:34.300 --> 00:01:37.930
Satsuki, can you give me the details?

00:01:38.140 --> 00:01:41.890
I got a call from Nozomi's mom last night.

00:01:48.310 --> 00:01:50.940
She said Nozomi went missing.

00:03:21.990 --> 00:03:26.910
The Girl who Disappeared

00:03:28.660 --> 00:03:30.000
I'm sorry.

00:03:30.160 --> 00:03:34.040
To think this is what would bring us together
after all this time.

00:03:34.210 --> 00:03:36.340
When did she go missing?

00:03:36.500 --> 00:03:40.050
It seems she went out yesterday morning,

00:03:40.260 --> 00:03:41.680
while I was shopping.

00:03:41.840 --> 00:03:43.300
That's all I know.

00:03:43.470 --> 00:03:46.180
I called her friends, but no one knows where she is.

00:03:46.720 --> 00:03:48.810
This was on her desk.

00:03:48.970 --> 00:03:52.730
I thought you, if anyone, might know something.

00:03:53.770 --> 00:03:56.020
Please excuse me.

00:03:57.360 --> 00:04:01.740
You said Nozomi was distancing herself
from games, right?

00:04:01.900 --> 00:04:05.240
Maybe she changed her mind and logged in to Re'Union.

00:04:05.410 --> 00:04:07.990
What does that have to do
with running away from home?

00:04:08.160 --> 00:04:11.330
That's what I'm trying to find out.

00:04:13.040 --> 00:04:15.630
You were right, Satsuki.

00:04:15.790 --> 00:04:17.670
She logged in just once. Two days ago.

00:04:18.000 --> 00:04:20.800
We have to tell Clive too.

00:04:20.970 --> 00:04:24.970
Let's talk before we go back to Re'Union.

00:04:27.470 --> 00:04:28.810
Two days ago...

00:04:36.230 --> 00:04:38.610
Sorry, I'm late.

00:04:38.770 --> 00:04:42.280
Analyzing the coordinates
took longer than I thought.

00:04:42.440 --> 00:04:44.660
Were you able to track Nozomi?

00:04:44.820 --> 00:04:47.240
Yeah. Take a look.

00:04:50.410 --> 00:04:53.000
First, she was in the city of Altogarden.

00:04:53.160 --> 00:04:56.170
That's where players appear when they first log in.

00:04:56.330 --> 00:04:57.790
So that's normal.

00:04:57.960 --> 00:05:01.130
Then she went to a couple of towns,

00:05:01.420 --> 00:05:03.840
-and headed to the hall.
-The hall?

00:05:04.590 --> 00:05:06.220
Where the dance party was held.

00:05:07.300 --> 00:05:09.720
But she left the hall after five minutes.

00:05:10.260 --> 00:05:12.350
Where did she go?

00:05:12.680 --> 00:05:13.640
The sky.

00:05:13.850 --> 00:05:14.850
The sky?

00:05:15.020 --> 00:05:17.350
I discovered something else important.

00:05:17.600 --> 00:05:18.900
Right now, Nozomi...

00:05:20.520 --> 00:05:21.900
is in Re'Union.

00:05:22.900 --> 00:05:25.400
Wait! Nozomi ran away from home!

00:05:25.860 --> 00:05:27.990
Where is she logged in from?

00:05:28.200 --> 00:05:31.660
Sorry. I wasn't able to track the IP she's logged in from.

00:05:31.830 --> 00:05:35.910
However, I have determined where she is in Re'Union.

00:05:36.540 --> 00:05:38.670
The Dungeon in the Heavens.

00:05:39.250 --> 00:05:40.710
The Dragons' Fortress.

00:05:55.600 --> 00:05:56.850
What are you doing?

00:05:57.020 --> 00:05:59.020
Oh, Haruto!

00:05:59.190 --> 00:06:01.190
The atmosphere's really changed.

00:06:01.360 --> 00:06:03.230
Did you do all this yourself?

00:06:05.860 --> 00:06:09.110
I want to make it as comfortable as can be.

00:06:09.280 --> 00:06:13.700
This is the place we all come home to, after all.

00:06:20.960 --> 00:06:23.130
What's gotten into you all of a sudden?

00:06:23.380 --> 00:06:26.340
You just looked like you wanted me to do this!

00:06:26.510 --> 00:06:28.380
The Empath Sense?

00:06:28.550 --> 00:06:30.760
I'm not using a Sense!

00:06:31.760 --> 00:06:35.890
There's an appropriate time
and place for that, you know.

00:06:36.060 --> 00:06:38.230
Clive!

00:06:38.390 --> 00:06:40.150
I don't care, but...

00:06:41.270 --> 00:06:42.610
You're already here.

00:06:44.400 --> 00:06:45.610
What?

00:06:45.780 --> 00:06:47.610
Oh, nothing.

00:06:48.990 --> 00:06:51.490
This is no time to be laughing, Clive.

00:06:51.660 --> 00:06:53.030
All right, Satsuki.

00:06:53.200 --> 00:06:54.660
Let's go, Asahi.

00:06:55.620 --> 00:06:58.580
We're all going to go look for Nozomi now.

00:06:58.750 --> 00:07:01.460
We're going to The Dragons' Fortress.

00:07:14.640 --> 00:07:17.310
So this is The Dragons' Fortress...

00:07:17.470 --> 00:07:18.520
Well...

00:07:18.730 --> 00:07:23.520
This looks like something
straight out of a fairytale.

00:07:23.730 --> 00:07:24.860
I see!

00:07:25.020 --> 00:07:26.440
There's no mistaking it.

00:07:27.070 --> 00:07:30.280
Yeah. This was created by the Dreamworld Sense.

00:07:31.070 --> 00:07:34.580
Yeah. This is Nozomi's castle.

00:07:36.540 --> 00:07:39.790
MEMORY

00:07:49.300 --> 00:07:50.840
Takanori, you take the back!

00:07:51.010 --> 00:07:52.760
-Okay!
-Satsuki and Clive, back us up!

00:07:52.930 --> 00:07:54.800
-Okay!
-Nozomi, keep it preoccupied!

00:07:55.220 --> 00:07:56.810
Okay!

00:07:56.970 --> 00:07:59.060
Haruto! Aim for its head from above!

00:08:05.230 --> 00:08:06.980
My body...

00:08:07.150 --> 00:08:08.230
A magic eye?

00:08:08.400 --> 00:08:10.940
Satsuki, can you control your elementals?

00:08:11.110 --> 00:08:12.110
Please, pierce it!

00:08:12.740 --> 00:08:15.030
Flaming Flash Bomb!

00:08:23.250 --> 00:08:24.330
Haruto!

00:08:25.170 --> 00:08:27.790
Why didn't you attack from above?

00:08:27.960 --> 00:08:29.300
Well, you know...

00:08:29.460 --> 00:08:32.300
I wanted to try something different.

00:08:33.130 --> 00:08:36.640
You should have just done what I told you!

00:08:36.800 --> 00:08:38.060
But if I did that--

00:08:38.220 --> 00:08:41.310
-Just do it!
-You two-- Asahi-- Haruto...

00:08:41.480 --> 00:08:43.020
We still won, right?

00:08:43.190 --> 00:08:44.980
-Stop fighting!
-That's not the point.

00:08:45.150 --> 00:08:46.810
I'm not one of your pawns!

00:08:46.980 --> 00:08:50.230
-We should only rely on Prophet Art when we have to!
-You two...

00:08:50.530 --> 00:08:52.990
I'd agree with you if you were stronger!

00:08:53.150 --> 00:08:55.410
What was that?

00:08:55.780 --> 00:08:58.740
-This friendship is over!
-This friendship is over!

00:09:09.710 --> 00:09:11.510
It's so big...

00:09:11.670 --> 00:09:15.680
Did Nozomi really make this all herself?

00:09:18.050 --> 00:09:21.640
She might have been able to do it six years ago.

00:09:22.310 --> 00:09:24.390
But she just got here.

00:09:24.560 --> 00:09:28.110
I don't think she could have made all this.

00:09:28.360 --> 00:09:29.940
And the design...

00:09:30.110 --> 00:09:31.900
It's like a battle arena.

00:09:34.820 --> 00:09:36.070
Stay on guard.

00:09:36.240 --> 00:09:38.530
It could be some kind of trap.

00:09:40.240 --> 00:09:41.580
Wait, Clive!

00:09:51.170 --> 00:09:53.050
What are those?

00:09:53.210 --> 00:09:56.970
Those are definitely Nozomi's familiars.

00:09:57.760 --> 00:09:58.840
Nozomi!

00:09:59.010 --> 00:10:00.430
Are you there, Nozomi?

00:10:00.600 --> 00:10:02.100
If you're there, answer me!

00:10:02.260 --> 00:10:04.850
Stop! Asahi!

00:10:05.140 --> 00:10:06.480
Nozomi!

00:10:08.690 --> 00:10:11.400
It looks like we're not welcome here!

00:10:16.360 --> 00:10:17.780
So it was a trap!

00:10:17.990 --> 00:10:19.030
So it seems.

00:10:19.610 --> 00:10:21.530
Flames of Eternal Dominion!

00:10:31.080 --> 00:10:33.550
These guys are persistent.

00:10:45.350 --> 00:10:46.480
Are you okay?

00:10:46.640 --> 00:10:48.270
Yeah.

00:10:51.940 --> 00:10:54.570
That's right...

00:10:54.730 --> 00:10:56.030
That voice!

00:10:56.530 --> 00:10:58.200
Takanori...

00:10:58.650 --> 00:11:01.620
you're all about protecting Satsuki, aren't you?

00:11:02.950 --> 00:11:05.540
It's been a long time, everyone.

00:11:07.000 --> 00:11:11.920
Seven Senses of the Re'Union

00:11:12.080 --> 00:11:14.290
What happened to you guys?

00:11:14.540 --> 00:11:17.550
Don't you remember what I look like?

00:11:17.710 --> 00:11:19.380
Satsuki, Haruto,

00:11:19.550 --> 00:11:21.840
we just saw each other the other day.

00:11:22.010 --> 00:11:24.430
How cruel of you.

00:11:24.890 --> 00:11:26.810
Is that you, Nozomi?

00:11:28.230 --> 00:11:31.100
It really is Asahi!

00:11:31.270 --> 00:11:35.070
I couldn't believe it until I saw you myself!

00:11:35.270 --> 00:11:38.320
Are you really Nozomi?

00:11:38.900 --> 00:11:41.150
That's right, Takanori.

00:11:41.320 --> 00:11:44.700
Did you come here to see me?

00:11:44.870 --> 00:11:45.950
That's right!

00:11:46.120 --> 00:11:49.290
Sorry. You're wasting your time.

00:11:49.870 --> 00:11:52.540
You see, I--

00:11:53.960 --> 00:11:57.300
Welcome to my world of dreams,

00:11:57.500 --> 00:12:00.470
honorable members of Subaru!

00:12:00.630 --> 00:12:02.180
You've arrived early.

00:12:03.140 --> 00:12:04.640
Wonderful.

00:12:04.800 --> 00:12:06.050
Gnosis!

00:12:06.260 --> 00:12:08.180
Correct!

00:12:08.350 --> 00:12:09.890
Fifth member of Gnosis,

00:12:10.060 --> 00:12:12.600
Cerinthus the dream mage, at your service.

00:12:12.770 --> 00:12:14.100
Nice to meet you!

00:12:14.440 --> 00:12:16.360
I'm the fourth member of Gnosis,

00:12:16.520 --> 00:12:18.400
Marcion the divine champion.

00:12:18.570 --> 00:12:20.240
The pleasure is mine.

00:12:20.570 --> 00:12:21.950
Nozomi! You...

00:12:22.110 --> 00:12:23.570
That's right!

00:12:23.740 --> 00:12:26.030
I joined Gnosis!

00:12:26.200 --> 00:12:30.120
This castle was created by me and Cerinthus!

00:12:41.510 --> 00:12:43.880
It's showtime!

00:12:44.380 --> 00:12:46.300
Ladies and gentlemen!

00:12:46.470 --> 00:12:50.180
Have a good look at my circus!

00:12:50.350 --> 00:12:51.930
Knock it off!

00:12:52.100 --> 00:12:55.400
We're going to take back our friend, Nozomi...

00:12:56.350 --> 00:12:57.940
by force, if need be!

00:13:10.330 --> 00:13:11.700
Cerinthus!

00:13:11.870 --> 00:13:14.080
Yes, ma'am!

00:13:23.630 --> 00:13:27.010
Shoot, Aerie! Threads of Blue Steel!

00:13:29.970 --> 00:13:31.470
How cute.

00:13:40.570 --> 00:13:42.110
Take this!

00:13:46.660 --> 00:13:47.700
What?

00:13:47.860 --> 00:13:49.620
The attack was erased?

00:13:50.830 --> 00:13:52.080
How strange!

00:13:52.240 --> 00:13:55.660
We didn't play any tricks!

00:13:55.830 --> 00:13:58.120
It's one of our linked Senses.

00:13:58.290 --> 00:13:59.710
The Swallowing Sense.

00:13:59.880 --> 00:14:01.210
It accepts everything,

00:14:01.380 --> 00:14:03.630
and accommodates every kind of happiness.

00:14:03.800 --> 00:14:05.670
It's the entrance to paradise.

00:14:06.260 --> 00:14:07.680
Come now!

00:14:07.970 --> 00:14:10.680
Let's all play together!

00:14:10.930 --> 00:14:13.220
Just like we used to!

00:14:14.600 --> 00:14:15.680
Nozomi!

00:14:15.850 --> 00:14:18.690
I wanted to see you!

00:14:18.940 --> 00:14:21.150
Sorry, Asahi.

00:14:21.310 --> 00:14:24.190
I don't have anything against you.

00:14:24.360 --> 00:14:26.150
Then why?

00:14:27.530 --> 00:14:29.070
What happened to you?

00:14:29.660 --> 00:14:31.700
Did I let you down?

00:14:31.870 --> 00:14:32.990
But, you know...

00:14:33.740 --> 00:14:36.250
It's my heart...

00:14:36.910 --> 00:14:38.960
that's really been let down!

00:14:39.330 --> 00:14:41.210
Nozomi, wake up!

00:14:41.670 --> 00:14:44.380
We all came to save you!

00:14:44.880 --> 00:14:46.340
Save me?

00:14:46.550 --> 00:14:50.300
I don't care about you, you little whore!

00:14:50.470 --> 00:14:54.140
-You knew how I felt, and still you laughed at me!
-You...

00:14:54.310 --> 00:14:56.520
Nozomi, what are you talking about?

00:14:57.230 --> 00:14:59.640
That's right...

00:15:00.100 --> 00:15:03.480
You don't get it, do you, Takanori?

00:15:05.110 --> 00:15:07.280
Nozomi, that's enough!

00:15:07.440 --> 00:15:10.530
We don't want to hurt you!

00:15:10.700 --> 00:15:13.740
There's no going back, Haruto.

00:15:13.910 --> 00:15:16.620
I've made up my mind.

00:15:17.540 --> 00:15:19.250
Alongside Gnosis...

00:15:22.500 --> 00:15:24.210
I'm going to...

00:15:24.380 --> 00:15:25.550
get revenge...

00:15:25.710 --> 00:15:27.920
for all the hurt!

00:15:36.600 --> 00:15:39.430
-Asahi!
-What are you talking about?

00:15:39.600 --> 00:15:40.940
Don't say that.

00:15:41.100 --> 00:15:42.190
Calm down!

00:15:42.810 --> 00:15:44.900
Let go of me!

00:15:47.570 --> 00:15:48.610
Haruto!

00:15:48.780 --> 00:15:50.450
Why won't you listen to me?

00:15:50.610 --> 00:15:51.610
What?

00:15:51.780 --> 00:15:54.740
I hate you. I hate you, Haruto!

00:15:57.450 --> 00:15:58.500
Asahi!

00:15:59.200 --> 00:16:01.000
What did you do to Asahi?

00:16:01.460 --> 00:16:07.130
I just made Asahi have a really fun dream.

00:16:08.630 --> 00:16:11.880
She's going to meet her demise tonight!

00:16:12.050 --> 00:16:15.430
We'll meet again, Subaru.

00:16:15.600 --> 00:16:16.640
Next time,

00:16:16.810 --> 00:16:20.520
I'll invite you into paradise.

00:16:21.100 --> 00:16:22.690
Nozomi!

00:16:36.910 --> 00:16:38.280
This is bad! Satsuki!

00:16:38.450 --> 00:16:39.450
Got it!

00:17:08.980 --> 00:17:10.940
I'm fine now.

00:17:11.110 --> 00:17:13.990
Sorry to make you worry.

00:17:14.990 --> 00:17:18.320
Wouldn't it be better to stay at Takanori's guild home?

00:17:19.200 --> 00:17:23.870
For me, this is where I feel the safest.

00:17:24.750 --> 00:17:28.170
Then maybe I'll stay here tonight too.

00:17:28.330 --> 00:17:29.670
I'm fine.

00:17:29.840 --> 00:17:34.010
You have your uncle and aunt,
and Haruna to worry about.

00:17:37.340 --> 00:17:40.010
Besides, I'm leaving Nozomi to you.

00:17:40.600 --> 00:17:43.890
I can't look for her in real life.

00:17:45.270 --> 00:17:48.900
Nozomi would never say stuff like that.

00:17:49.060 --> 00:17:50.400
Yeah.

00:17:51.020 --> 00:17:55.820
I heard Takanori mobilized Illuminati
and went to look for her.

00:17:56.700 --> 00:18:00.160
But we still don't know where Nozomi is.

00:18:01.200 --> 00:18:03.370
Asahi, thank goodness.

00:18:03.540 --> 00:18:06.000
The princess finally awakens.

00:18:06.160 --> 00:18:08.790
She's adamant about staying here.

00:18:09.750 --> 00:18:12.880
I'll look after her for a while.

00:18:13.050 --> 00:18:16.840
There's the time zone difference,
and my schedule is more flexible than yours.

00:18:17.010 --> 00:18:19.890
You're in high school too, right?

00:18:20.390 --> 00:18:21.890
I thought I told you...

00:18:22.060 --> 00:18:23.930
I skipped a grade. I'm in college now.

00:18:24.100 --> 00:18:25.140
Seriously?

00:18:25.310 --> 00:18:26.940
I didn't know that!

00:18:27.560 --> 00:18:29.190
Anyways...

00:18:29.350 --> 00:18:31.440
You guys have something you have to do.

00:18:32.270 --> 00:18:33.320
Yeah.

00:18:33.480 --> 00:18:35.150
That's right.

00:18:40.870 --> 00:18:46.120
I bet Nozomi's dad and mom are worried.

00:18:46.700 --> 00:18:49.670
We just have to leave it to Haruto and the others.

00:18:50.250 --> 00:18:52.250
I...

00:18:53.670 --> 00:18:56.050
Even if something happens to me,

00:18:56.210 --> 00:18:59.130
no one would worry about me. That's good.

00:19:02.140 --> 00:19:03.470
Hey, Asahi.

00:19:03.890 --> 00:19:05.720
Are you hungry?

00:19:05.930 --> 00:19:07.890
What's this, all of a sudden?

00:19:08.060 --> 00:19:10.230
There's no food here, right?

00:19:10.400 --> 00:19:14.900
Takanori's followers are standing guard
outside this base.

00:19:15.190 --> 00:19:16.990
Want me to go catch a fish?

00:19:17.150 --> 00:19:18.280
Really?

00:19:18.440 --> 00:19:21.110
I'll catch a big one.

00:19:21.490 --> 00:19:22.490
Yeah!

00:19:22.660 --> 00:19:24.410
I can't wait!

00:19:29.870 --> 00:19:36.300
I just made Asahi have a really fun dream.

00:19:42.220 --> 00:19:48.020
I hired 10 special detectives to search for Nozomi.

00:19:48.600 --> 00:19:51.900
So I guess an amateur wouldn't be much help.

00:19:52.600 --> 00:19:55.480
Then why did you want to see us?

00:19:55.650 --> 00:19:57.530
Just to treat us to some cake?

00:19:57.690 --> 00:19:59.150
I didn't even eat any.

00:20:00.240 --> 00:20:03.780
What she said to me at that castle...

00:20:05.740 --> 00:20:08.080
That's right...

00:20:08.450 --> 00:20:12.920
Takanori wants to protect Satsuki.

00:20:14.170 --> 00:20:17.090
You don't get it, do you, Takanori?

00:20:19.300 --> 00:20:25.430
I think the reason Nozomi got that way
is because of me.

00:20:25.760 --> 00:20:27.260
I couldn't really say.

00:20:27.430 --> 00:20:29.600
Honestly, you guys...

00:20:29.770 --> 00:20:31.770
Satsuki, do you know why?

00:20:31.940 --> 00:20:33.940
If you do, please tell us.

00:20:35.310 --> 00:20:37.020
It's my fault too.

00:20:37.190 --> 00:20:40.190
I got carried away and danced with you.

00:20:40.740 --> 00:20:42.030
What are you talking about?

00:20:42.200 --> 00:20:44.820
Think about what she did after logging in.

00:20:44.990 --> 00:20:46.160
Don't you get it?

00:20:46.320 --> 00:20:49.910
Let's see, she left the dance, and went to the sky.

00:20:50.080 --> 00:20:52.620
The problem is what happened before that.

00:20:52.870 --> 00:20:56.630
It's something you of all people were supposed to notice.

00:20:57.290 --> 00:20:59.500
I'm sorry, Nozomi...

00:21:00.130 --> 00:21:02.470
Ready? Listen closely.

00:21:02.630 --> 00:21:04.340
Okay.

00:21:04.720 --> 00:21:08.010
She saw us dancing together

00:21:08.180 --> 00:21:10.640
and ran away in shock.

00:21:10.810 --> 00:21:12.390
It's because...

00:21:12.890 --> 00:21:15.600
she's in love with you.

00:21:17.360 --> 00:21:18.690
You mean...

00:21:18.860 --> 00:21:21.650
she saw us dance together

00:21:21.820 --> 00:21:24.490
and thought we were a couple?

00:21:24.650 --> 00:21:26.570
So it's finally clear to you?

00:21:26.780 --> 00:21:28.320
You idiot.

00:21:29.530 --> 00:21:34.080
They took advantage of her jealousy.

00:21:34.960 --> 00:21:37.330
I'm the worst.

00:21:38.040 --> 00:21:39.750
I'm so sorry.

00:21:39.920 --> 00:21:42.670
Tell that to her.

00:21:42.840 --> 00:21:44.630
I know.

00:21:45.630 --> 00:21:47.590
I'll stop her.

00:21:50.260 --> 00:21:52.270
Why am I so dizzy?

00:21:52.430 --> 00:21:54.480
Something's wrong.

00:21:54.930 --> 00:21:59.190
I felt it too. What was that?

00:21:59.650 --> 00:22:00.730
The cake is...?

00:22:01.270 --> 00:22:02.730
What?

00:22:04.780 --> 00:22:08.320
That's impossible! I got here around 11!

00:22:08.530 --> 00:22:10.830
It hasn't even been an hour since then!

00:22:11.370 --> 00:22:12.580
Time is...

00:22:14.080 --> 00:22:16.660
The flow of time

00:22:16.830 --> 00:22:21.590
is akin to the course of a fixed destiny.

00:23:55.470 --> 00:23:58.350
I shouldn’t have asked Satsuki out.

00:23:58.520 --> 00:23:59.890
Excuse me?

00:24:00.060 --> 00:24:01.600
Take this cake!

00:24:01.770 --> 00:24:04.360
Episode 11, "Creeping Nightmare."

00:24:04.520 --> 00:24:08.280
I am not that easy. Didn't you know?

00:24:08.440 --> 00:24:09.940
I didn't know that!
